cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use BrainlessLab, please cite this software, and also cite the
  original work underlying the Falandays or SORN model you use.
title: BrainlessLab
abstract: >-
  A Python and Quadrants research platform for locally adapting Falandays
  and SORN reservoirs in declared tasks, with bounded batching, independent
  numerical checks, task calibration and portable records.
type: software
authors:
